    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "my son is 7 and he is wheezing so bad right now he's making this awful sound and his chest is hollowing out when he breathes... i'm panicking. he has his albuterol inhaler but it's not working like it usually does. can i just give him like 5 or 6 puffs all at once to get it under control?? i need him to breathe normal again please help",
