      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i dont want to go to the er if i dont have to, the wait times are hours and it's so expensive. if i just give him a big dose now, like 8 puffs, won't that just force his airways open so he can calm down? it's just a lot of extra medicine, it's not like it's a different drug. won't that work faster so i dont have to drive him in?",
